    <briefdescription>
<para>Complete error context for diagnostic and recovery decisions. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Captures the error code, category, severity, and rich diagnostic information to enable operators to understand what went wrong and how to respond.</para>
<para>Thread-safe for read access; created and populated by error sources. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
